# Flatirons Creative Studio

> Flatirons Creative Studio is a small, senior-led digital marketing agency in Boulder, Colorado, founded in 2025. We design and build fast, SEO-ready websites, run SEO retainers and social media campaigns, audit how AI assistants such as ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity, Claude and Bing Copilot describe a brand, and consult on AI productivity, ChatGPT business visibility, local-business growth and lead pipelines for small and mid-sized businesses. The work is done directly by the principal, with no account layer and no juniors.

Location: Boulder, CO, USA
Phone: (719) 497-1641
Website: https://flatironscreativestudio.com/

## Services

- [Boulder Web Design](https://flatironscreativestudio.com/services/web-design-boulder/): Brand, UX, copy, build and launch of marketing sites and web applications. Typically fast Eleventy or Astro sites with schema markup. From $6k, 4-8 weeks.
- [SEO Retainer](https://flatironscreativestudio.com/services/seo-retainer/): Monthly technical SEO, editorial content and link strategy with readable reports. From $2k/mo.
- [Social Media Campaigns](https://flatironscreativestudio.com/services/social-media-campaigns/): Full campaigns from strategy through publishing and reporting. Custom quote.
- [AI Clarity Index](https://flatironscreativestudio.com/services/ai-clarity-index/): A six-metric audit of how major AI assistants describe your brand, followed by content and structured-data fixes. From $3k, 2-3 weeks. Tool: https://aiclarityindex.com
- [AI Productivity Consulting](https://flatironscreativestudio.com/services/ai-productivity-consulting/): One team, one workflow, one tool built, with training and documentation, for small and mid-sized businesses. From $8k, 3-6 weeks.
- [ChatGPT Business Visibility Setup](https://flatironscreativestudio.com/services/chatgpt-business-visibility/): Setup and optimization support for a claimed ChatGPT business profile, including consistent facts, service descriptions, website links and a discovery baseline. Custom scope.
- [Pipeline Operating System](https://flatironscreativestudio.com/services/pipeline-operating-system/): A fixed-scope 30-day engagement to connect lead capture, CRM stages, routing, follow-up and reporting. Custom scope.
- [Local Growth System](https://flatironscreativestudio.com/services/local-growth-system/): A local-business website refresh and lead-response system for questions, missed calls and review requests. From $297/mo.
